Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, we've finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.99,0:05:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty long days of ferocious\Nbattles on this journey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,have all come down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, even the windows\Nare barred from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure looks abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I'm sure you feel it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This deathly atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A devil who possesses the\Nlife force of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain it's Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in there, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The conclusion of this journey\Nends a long chapter of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful he is,\NI'll cut him up with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, it is most dangerous\Nto go off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Once inside, you must follow Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar's instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you\Nto worry so much, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that after coming all this\Nway, you're starting to get cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You should look after that dumb dog\Ninstead of worrying about what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Although when the time comes,\Nhe'll probably run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not force you to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be our biggest battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We will risk our lives to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave you all of\Nthe gum I have with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If I should survive, I will personally\Ntake you back to your hometown in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Dio already knows we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's bust him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:09:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, be strong, Holly.\NMrs. Joestar, I—I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,how you feel but miss holly is in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite frankly she can't\Nhear you speak therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you really should go and rest for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't had any sleep for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you say something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When her life hangs by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lance's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Would joseph and jotaro\Nstill half a world away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At such a critical moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd watch over her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, are you awake, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know right now that Papa and Jotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,are doing their best to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this, she\Nis still unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How could she possibly\Nspeak so coherently?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in your son, my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To believe in him is\Nour role in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Dio's coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to let the sunlight in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've known this man we're about to meet\Nsince before Jotaro and I were even born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the blood of the Joestar\Nstands knows this man all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle we are about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the\Noutcome, I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how long are we\Ngoing to stare at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.77,0:12:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If no one else is going to\Ndo it, then I'll open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be so careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What careless did I hear\Nyou say? You think I'm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Careless, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar allow me to use my fire here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,hey you better not ignore me Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Abdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:13:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what has just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're not careful, we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.15,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You have finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I must congratulate you\Nall for your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So then you're... Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Dio's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His secret is he's able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Iced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have heard about him from Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I took him under my wing, and\Nhe has become my right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so anxious all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of me, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:16:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He obeys me without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Without any fear or anxiety whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iced. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cut your head off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you understand why\Nhe obeys me so blindly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It is because he feels\Nsecure about serving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Many have been alienated by society\Nbecause of the superior power they possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,their stand abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.15,0:16:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But by serving me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,worthless feelings like loneliness\Nand insecurity are gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It is because I, Dio, am the\Nultimate, absolute power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:17:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A worthy man such as Eist shouldn't\Nbe left to die in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,May you resurrect with the\Nblood from my veins, Eist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,now back to the four of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,who came all the way to Egypt with some\Ncrazed notion of killing me, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Joseph and Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I must give you the\Npunishment of absolute death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I must end my karma\Nwith the Joestar family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Polnareff, it would be\Nsuch a waste to have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an unbelievably\Ntalented stand-user.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you become my servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You, along with that dog over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you do decide to become my servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,both of you will have the absolute\Nsecurity of never fearing death again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be hard of hearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Dio,\Nand answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you, where did you take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother yourself\Nwith such petty details?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell him, Iced?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Avdol is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He was swallowed up by a sub-dimension my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,stand created and has\Ndisappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where Avdol has gone is\Na mystery, even to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is such a waste to\Nkill a man like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with him, iced.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the wrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, old man, you should feel honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Dio, am going to deal\Nwith you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the dog run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It would certainly\Nappear that that dog has
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,more brains than the two of you combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He absorbs everything\Nin his path as he moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere around to take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice I took a chunk\Nout of your foot first,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so you won't be able\Nto scurry off anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have to discipline\Nyou for foolishly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking you can disobey\Nthe all-powerful Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you want it next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arm or in your gut?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword can only cut him\Nwhen he's not invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio, why you... No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.51,0:22:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.61,0:22:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you planning\Nto take to come up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what are you attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He never even moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.53,0:22:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to tell you the truth, Joseph, there\Nis a little something I need from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.91,0:23:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly precise, Joseph,\NI need fresh blood from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,From the neck down, this body is that of\Nmy long-standing enemy, Jonathan Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.67,0:23:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and it is not a comfortable fit just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Among all the humans alive, Joseph, you\Nare the Joestar family's oldest survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.93,0:23:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blood matches Jonathan's\Nmore closely than anyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,By sucking your fresh blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.53,0:23:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fully conquer this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.69,0:23:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and I shall put an end to this\Nkarma with the Joestar family
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that has plagued me for one\Nhundred long and tiresome years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only me he's after.\NHurry up! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.21,0:23:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.37,0:23:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell should I run now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:24:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be wise to listen to\Nyour elders in this case, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.37,0:24:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I have no intention\Nof letting you go that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't about speed or playing tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be Dio's stand? And?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.45,0:24:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.51,0:24:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You mark the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.37,0:25:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.61,0:25:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.79,0:25:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not for very long, but you really\Nshould thank Avdol for extending your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.27,0:25:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In that fleeting moment, if\Nhe hadn't pushed you away,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.65,0:25:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you would have been swallowed\Nup into the sub-dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have survived if he tried to\Nescape by himself and not save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.63,0:26:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What a complete idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.47,0:26:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.55,0:26:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It said the more foolish you\Nare, the younger you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you can still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.89,0:26:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the end of a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.19,0:26:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After I send you to hell, you'll have\Na long time to regret your stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.75,0:26:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.71,0:26:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.62,0:26:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.03,0:27:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.49,0:27:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You came...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.69,0:27:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.35,0:27:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be long gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.21,0:27:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think of\Nyou as part of our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.19,0:27:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.31,0:27:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.47,0:27:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You were able to avenge Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have\Ndone it myself, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.85,0:27:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Iggy, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.93,0:27:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.59,0:27:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.87,0:28:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You lowly, insignificant beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you defy the will\Nand command of Lord Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.57,0:28:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,KNOW YOUR PLACE!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.19,0:28:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that eager to\Npledge loyalty to Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.95,0:28:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can do so in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.87,0:28:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Twa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.45,0:29:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Iggy...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything else\Nyou can do, old fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.41,0:29:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is about to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.97,0:30:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.47,0:30:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.47,0:30:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wincerom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wincerom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.71,0:32:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wincerom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.97,0:32:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A l 'alma vinci, a l 'alma vinci,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,a l 'alma
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.37,0:32:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,vinci ro.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.11,0:34:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.27,0:34:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless you.
